text.section:
A limited liability company restating its articles of organization shall file with the Commission articles of restatement setting forth:

The name of the limited liability company immediately prior to restatement;


Whether the restatement contains an amendment to the articles of organization;


The text of the restated articles of organization or amended and restated articles of organization;


The date of adoption of the articles of restatement; and


A statement that the restatement was adopted by a vote of the members, by the managers or by the organizers in accordance with this chapter, as the case may be.
